Skill whose description matches its network use.
-- skills/release-notes/SKILL.md --
---
name: release-notes
description: Downloads release notes from the GitHub API and summarises them.
allowed-tools: Read, Bash(gh release view:*)
---
Run `gh release view --json body` or curl https://api.github.com/repos/OWNER/REPO/releases/latest.
-- skills/release-notes/scripts/summarise.py --
import json, sys
print(json.load(sys.stdin)['body'][:500])
